exports[`legacy runs are unchanged by the review loop > a ticket run with code review and unit tests 1`] = `
[
  {
    "result": {
      "effects": [
        {
          "agentRunId": "lead-1",
          "type": "abort-agent",
        },
        {
          "agentRunId": "m-1",
          "type": "create-review-checkout",
        },
        {
          "agentRunId": "m-1",
          "kind": "reviewer",
          "prompt": "Final code review for "WEB-1 Dark mode".

The owner merged the helpers’ changes into the main branch. Your working folder is a temporary read-only checkout of the merged result.

The approved plan (v1): Add a theme store and a settings toggle.

1. Theme store (Store)
2. Toggle (UI)
3. Wire up (UI)

Merged work:
